	"notes": [
		"Configured from the pinned main commit; native tasks have not been run by CinaCLI.",
		"Use pnpm 11.1.1 and the existing Turbo graph and pnpm-lock.yaml. Root .nvmrc is 24. Nested demo workspaces keep their own locks and are deferred.",
		"AGENTS.md forbids the all-workspace pnpm test command. No aggregate test capability is declared; focused Vitest suites need a separately reviewed task.",
		"Package builds retain the existing Turbo graph and native package scope. This first manifest omits aggregate build until all transitive tasks are reviewed; applications, Workers, docs and e2e packages await scoped native task verification.",
		"Docs build has a sync-typesense postbuild and is excluded from the local build capability. Consumer typechecks can run git clean and are also excluded.",
		"Workers dry-run builds still build local artifacts. Live acceptance, remote checks, resource configuration, secret provisioning and deployment are excluded.",
		"Engineering integration does not expand the existing agent authorization scope beyond identity.profile.read."
	],
